    <tags>cafe awake caffeine keep-awake sleep power tray utility</tags>
    <summary>Keep your PC awake from the tray</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
A coffee cup in the notification area that keeps Windows from going to sleep,
like PowerToys Awake without the rest of PowerToys.

* Keep awake indefinitely, for a set time, or until a time of day.
* Optionally keep the screen on too.
* Left-click the cup to toggle; switch off and your normal power plan applies.
* Never edits your power plan: it asks Windows not to sleep, and the request
  ends when Cafe stops, even if it crashes.

A single small executable with no runtime dependencies.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/kidchenko/cafe/releases</releaseNotes>
